WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:15,910
I wonder if you have thoughts about grouting sheets or grouting pads to reduce inflammation?

00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:20,910
If so, is there a brand or product that you'd recommend?

00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:25,910
Grouting sheets and grouting pads, yes, can be used.

00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:31,910
We currently are out of grouting pads, and I don't know that we'll get them back in.

00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:35,910
We might have a few left if you call Megan next week.

00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:40,910
We'll see grouting sheets we have a lot left, and we're actually having a...

00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:45,910
Pretty sure Dustin's having a huge sale this weekend, Black Friday.

00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:50,910
So, do look at your e-mail, see if you're going to e-mail on Thursday or Friday,

00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:52,910
with a discount off the grouting sheets.

00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:55,910
Now, you could use a grouting sheet for a pad, too.

00:00:55,910 --> 00:01:01,910
I mean, you could keep it folded up and sit on it and your chair and then plug it into the grouting.

00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:05,910
So, the grouting sheets are more versatile that way.

00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:09,910
Maybe they're not as stylish as the full type grouting pad,

00:01:09,910 --> 00:01:15,910
that the grouting sheets are larger, and they can be used for more things.

00:01:15,910 --> 00:01:18,910
And then tie that into the question from the chat,

00:01:18,910 --> 00:01:22,910
would it be okay to use a grouting pad with the rife machine?

00:01:22,910 --> 00:01:26,910
If you're going to use a grouting pad or a grouting sheet with the rife machine,

00:01:26,910 --> 00:01:29,910
I suggest you use it on just the lower half of your body.

00:01:29,910 --> 00:01:32,910
So, those that are using the rife machine at night,

00:01:32,910 --> 00:01:35,910
I always recommend that you only use the grouting sheet.

00:01:35,910 --> 00:01:39,910
You put the grouting sheet at the lower half of your bed,

00:01:39,910 --> 00:01:44,910
because you don't want the frequencies to get drawn through the ground.

00:01:44,910 --> 00:01:47,910
So, when you have something connected to a grouting,

00:01:47,910 --> 00:01:49,910
it's going to attract frequencies,

00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:53,910
so we don't want to lose them and not have them go through your body.

00:01:53,910 --> 00:01:56,910
Now, again, it depends on how you use it.

00:01:56,910 --> 00:01:59,910
So, you're late, you sleep only on your back,

00:01:59,910 --> 00:02:03,910
and you have a grouting sheet under the fitted sheet,

00:02:03,910 --> 00:02:06,910
so you're laying on top of a grouting sheet,

00:02:06,910 --> 00:02:09,910
and you put the bulb on your belly,

00:02:09,910 --> 00:02:11,910
and it stays on your belly all night long.

00:02:11,910 --> 00:02:16,910
So, theoretically, the frequencies are going through you with it to the ground,

00:02:16,910 --> 00:02:20,910
so you're still getting all those frequencies.

00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:22,910
But that's not real.

00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,910
I mean, most people are rolling around.

00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:27,910
The bulbs lay next to them part of the night.

00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:29,910
It's not always on their belly.

00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:32,910
So, therefore, I tell people to put the grouting sheets

00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:35,910
on the lower half of the bed.

00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:37,910
That's better operation.

